      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6b3cc227a56787575ebb4|full_name}: I'm not asking for just a counter, but a more complex system. A counter is just one of its applications.\n\nIf you want to be mind blown, look at all that Minecraft adventure maps made using scoreboards and command blocks. Lest, there's a in-game working WorldEdit (a world editor) entirely with command blocks and even a BASIC interpreter.\n\nWe already have command blocks, or something like that in VR Chat (triggers).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
