  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-01-14T05:28:33.623Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you have no idea what I'm talking about, basically this: http://minecraft.gamepedia.com/Scoreboard\n\nIt would greatly expand what you could do with triggers, like tagging and adding specific scores to players. At the moment, the current team system in the games are really lackluster. Also, a way to print out numbers or values from said scoreboards. It could also be like a 'variable' system.",
